    "type": "game",
    "name": "XIII - A Final Game of Tarot With Death",
    "steam_appid": 3381140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >XIII: A Final Game of Tarot With Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For how long can you play with death?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/8b11a173cddfa63eeecf40bf5000d442.poster.avif?t=1736434552\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/8b11a173cddfa63eeecf40bf5000d442.webm?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/8b11a173cddfa63eeecf40bf5000d442.mp4?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A psychedelic tarot game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death comes to us all, and at last, your time has come. What you didn't expect was that the reaper herself would want to read your past. Play your cards right and keep your Karma balanced\u2014the closer to zero, the better. Try to get the highest score possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go beyond your limits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>XIII: A Final Game of Tarot With Death</i> is a casual game designed to hypnotize you for a few hours, especially appealing to high-score lovers. Compete with your friends and try to survive to your absolute limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the numerical relations between cards and their positions to keep the final sum as close to zero as possible. If you play well, you'll receive money to buy magical coins that modify the cards on the board. Manage these resources intelligently to get as far as you can\u2014and watch out for RNGesus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/0a3c6ef744089624781598b2745bbed6.poster.avif?t=1736434552\" width=580 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/0a3c6ef744089624781598b2745bbed6.webm?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/0a3c6ef744089624781598b2745bbed6.mp4?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short and sweet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 hours? Nah! This is a simple and short game, but really fun. It'll grant more than a few hours for those who'd like a special challenge: going beyond the limits of tarot and beating round 23.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S: This game was originally developed for a game jam and will be the first of many to be released on steam! Thank you to everyone who buys it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >XIII: A Final Game of Tarot With Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For how long can you play with death?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/8b11a173cddfa63eeecf40bf5000d442.poster.avif?t=1736434552\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/8b11a173cddfa63eeecf40bf5000d442.webm?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/8b11a173cddfa63eeecf40bf5000d442.mp4?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A psychedelic tarot game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death comes to us all, and at last, your time has come. What you didn't expect was that the reaper herself would want to read your past. Play your cards right and keep your Karma balanced\u2014the closer to zero, the better. Try to get the highest score possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go beyond your limits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>XIII: A Final Game of Tarot With Death</i> is a casual game designed to hypnotize you for a few hours, especially appealing to high-score lovers. Compete with your friends and try to survive to your absolute limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the numerical relations between cards and their positions to keep the final sum as close to zero as possible. If you play well, you'll receive money to buy magical coins that modify the cards on the board. Manage these resources intelligently to get as far as you can\u2014and watch out for RNGesus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/0a3c6ef744089624781598b2745bbed6.poster.avif?t=1736434552\" width=580 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/0a3c6ef744089624781598b2745bbed6.webm?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381140/extras/0a3c6ef744089624781598b2745bbed6.mp4?t=1736434552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short and sweet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 hours? Nah! This is a simple and short game, but really fun. It'll grant more than a few hours for those who'd like a special challenge: going beyond the limits of tarot and beating round 23.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S: This game was originally developed for a game jam and will be the first of many to be released on steam! Thank you to everyone who buys it!</p>",
    "short_description": "XIII is a hypnotic and psychedelic card game. Let death read your future with tarot cards and decide your fate. Play the right cards in the right places to keep the scales of karma in check, for that's the only way to delay the inevitable. And never forget: death comes to us all.",
